OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle wood chipping
OL,4,Ablaze near M62
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews in North Yorkshire have been
OL,7,Ftackling a blaze at a business premises
OL,8,Fwhich created smoke visible from the
OL,9,FM62.
OL,11,FCrews were called to reports of wood
OL,12,Fwaste and wood chippings on fire on
OL,13,FHeck and Pollington Lane, near Great
OL,14,FHeck, at 23:41 BST on Tuesday.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fsaid a fire of about 323 sq ft (30 sq
OL,18,Fm) was being fought by crews from
OL,19,Facross the county, including appliances
OL,20,Ffrom Selby, Harrogate, Thirsk and
OL,21,FRichmond. Crews from Humberside and
OL,22,FSouth Yorkshire had also attended.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
