OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle wood chipping
OL,4,Ablaze near M62
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire was located in a pile of wood
OL,7,Fwaste approx 30m by 200m and the fire
OL,8,Fservice said it was expected they would
OL,9,Fbe at the scene through the morning.
